MEADOWLARK WEEKLY - Issue #212

Hi Jordan,

This week's essay: Why small teams ship faster. We looked at 40 product
launches from the last year and found that team size predicted cycle time
better than budget did.
Read it: https://meadowlark-weekly.example/issues/212/small-teams

Three tools we liked
- Notchboard: a lightweight retro board that works in the browser.
- Fieldnote CLI: turn shell history into a daily log.
- Tidy Tabs: closes tabs you have not looked at in 30 days.

Reader question
"How do you run a retro when half the team is async?" We answer in the
full issue.

Until next Monday,
Sam and the Meadowlark team

--
